  "details": "Sometimes people hop back and forth between multiple instances, for example if I have two friend groups in two friends+ instances, and I jump between them every 10-15 minutes to talk to people on both sides, I want an easy option in the menu to hop into a specific instance I was already in earlier.\nVRChat's \"recent worlds\" list gives you a list of worlds you were in, but not a list of the specific instances you were on. It should be possible to have a specific instance history.\nThis is especially useful when jumping in and out of Invite+ instances. e.g. lets say I was in an Invite+ a friend hosted, and my client crashed or had a network error that kicked me out (unfortunately happens often in vrchat), and I just want to get back in as soon as I restart my client, I don't want to have to inconvenience my friend by asking them to send me an invite again, I just want to rejoin again on my own via instance history.",
